e\n  with Kueue admission and amd.com/gpu quota.\n- The content is technically reviewed against the implementations (serving\n  runtime, build pipeline, quota handling, and training support) before\n  publication.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-4 (P2)**: Documentation states supported AMD hardware, driver\n  prerequisites, and the validated model list. This epic is the entirety of\n  HLR-4.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":51193,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad1452d411d62271","agent_id":"af035a9c6d4afd483","session_id":"ee31f95d-bee0-49c9-bebd-617d8f30fd03","uuid":"6d7e5397-233a-4df5-a537-19c7f7d3a054","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:10:12.246Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9020 into epics"}
