{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b635f0abdaf7fd25","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9020-E004\n3\ttitle: Konflux build pipeline for the vLLM ROCm image variant\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9020\n5\tcomponent: Serving Runtimes\n6\tteam: RHOAI Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 0\n16\t  external_dependency: 0\n17\t  human_process_gates: 0\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 6\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Konflux build pipeline for the vLLM ROCm image variant\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic onboards the vLLM ROCm image variant onto the midstream Konflux\n34\tbuild pipeline. The vLLM midstream repository is already Konflux-onboarded\n35\tfor its existing (CUDA) images; the ROCm variant is a new container image in\n36\tthat existing repository and needs its own pipeline configuration. This work\n37\truns in parallel with the runtime productization work — the coupling is\n38\tenforced by a build-pipeline-green acceptance criterion on the productization\n39\twork, not by a scheduling dependency.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- Add Konflux pipeline configuration for the ROCm image variant in the\n44\t  existing midstream vLLM repository (new image, new base image, ROCm build\n45\t  recipe).\n46\t- Integrate the new pipeline with the repository's existing release machinery\n47\t  so the ROCm variant is built and released per platform version alongside\n48\t  the existing runtime images.\n49\t- Make the pipeline configuration accept the base-image selection as\n50\t  configuration (the pinned upstream ROCm base or build-from-source choice is\n51\t  filled in at execution time per the base-image strategy, and is not a\n52\t  scheduling dependency for this work).\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- Konflux pipeline configuration for the ROCm vLLM image variant exists in\n57\t  the midstream repository.\n58\t- The pipeline produces a green build of the ROCm image variant.\n59\t- The ROCm variant pipeline is integrated with the repository's existing\n60\t  release machinery (built and released per platform version).\n61\t\n62\t## HLR Traceability\n63\t\n64\t- **HLR-2 (P0)**: enables the productization of a supported vLLM ROCm serving\n65\t  runtime by providing its build pipeline (enabler; the repository is already\n66\t  Konflux-onboarded for existing images, so this covers the new image variant\n67\t  only).\n68\t\n69\t## Risks\n70\t\n71\t- ROCm builds may need build-host capabilities (ROCm toolchain) that the\n72\t  standard build environment lacks; if so, the pipeline configuration work\n73\t  includes provisioning the required build recipe.\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2a98fe0ecec4dd8","agent_id":"a984887860b9faab1","session_id":"ee31f95d-bee0-49c9-bebd-617d8f30fd03","uuid":"c72b853f-dd1e-42aa-882b-bcc76be5c135","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:17:21.467Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b635f0abdaf7fd25","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
