KServe InferenceServices on AMD GPU nodes.\n55\t- **Training on ROCm**: single- and multi-GPU PyTorchJob training on AMD GPU\n56\t  nodes, including job admission through Kueue with amd.com/gpu quota.\n57\t- **Base images**: the PyTorch ROCm worker image strategy and the vLLM ROCm\n58\t  runtime image, per the base-image strategy selected by the cadence\n59\t  assessment.\n60\t\n61\t## Acceptance Criteria\n62\t\n63\t- Published documentation states the supported AMD hardware and the driver\n64\t  prerequisites.\n65\t- The documented validated model list matches the validation campaign's\n66\t  go/no-go outcome and the productized runtime's supported model set.\n67\t- The training documentation covers single- and multi-GPU PyTorchJob usage\n68\t  with Kueue admission and amd.com/gpu quota.\n69\t- The content is technically reviewed against the implementations (serving\n70\t  runtime, build pipeline, quota handling, and training support) before\n71\t  publication.\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\t- **HLR-4 (P2)**: Documentation states supported AMD hardware, driver\n76\t  prerequisites, and the validated model list. This epic is the entirety of\n77\t  HLR-4.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2a98fe0ecec4dd8","agent_id":"a984887860b9faab1","session_id":"ee31f95d-bee0-49c9-bebd-617d8f30fd03","uuid":"157a59d6-677f-4e5d-9d88-40bcf1103840","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:17:25.693Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-abaf1fc92aeb198c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9020 decomposition"}
